# Spec & iteration development

Read and follow [`.agent_rules/spec-development.md`](../../.agent_rules/spec-development.md) exactly.

Before planning or coding:

1. Read [`spec/master.md`](../../spec/master.md) → **Current iteration**
2. Read the active `spec/iteration-NN-roadmap.md`
3. Do **not** implement `iteration-XX-ideas.md` unless capturing a new idea

When editing `spec/`: use the emoji conventions and file templates in `spec-development.md`. Keep ideas as one-line bullets; do not create a future iteration roadmap until the current iteration is done.

**Stable spec** (`mission.md`, `tech-stack.md`): follow §6–§8 in `spec-development.md` — rare changes only; no task checkboxes; deferrals go to ideas files.
